    "updated_at": "2023-01-11T13:54:23Z",
    "body": "It does attempt to create the file, but it will not attempt to create the directory. It should work if you create a `.config` directory in your home directory.\r\n\r\nOr just create a new file `~/.config/starship.toml` with the following contents:\r\n```toml\r\n[conda]\r\nignore_base = false\r\n```",
